\pard\qc{\f1\fs32\b\cf2 Welcome to Go Ai Setup\par}
\pard\qc{\f0\fs20\cf3 by Go Projects, Inc.\par}
\par
\pard\ql\f0\fs20

Before you continue, please read the following important information about Go Ai.\par
\par
{\b\cf2 WHAT IS GO AI?}\par
Go Ai is an intelligent AI assistant built by Go Projects, Inc. It gives you access to powerful AI chat, voice interaction, image generation, and file analysis \f1\endash\f0  all wrapped in a beautiful, fast desktop experience.\par
\par
{\b\cf2 SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS}\par
\bullet  Windows 10 / Windows 11 (64-bit)\par
\bullet  At least 200 MB of free disk space\par
\bullet  Active internet connection (required for AI features)\par
\bullet  Minimum 4 GB RAM recommended\par
\par
{\b\cf2 WHAT WILL BE INSTALLED?}\par
\bullet  Go Ai application files in Program Files\par
\bullet  A Desktop shortcut for quick access\par
\bullet  A Start Menu entry under "Go Projects"\par
\bullet  An uninstaller registered in Windows "Add or Remove Programs"\par
\par
{\b\cf2 DATA & PRIVACY}\par
Go Ai does not store your chat history locally. All conversations are processed securely through our cloud service. Your account data is protected under our Privacy Policy available at:\par
https://go-ai-official.vercel.app\par
\par
{\b\cf2 INTERNET CONNECTION}\par
This application requires an active internet connection to function. AI features, chat history, and account management all require connectivity to our servers.\par
\par
\cf3 Click "Next" to review the License Agreement and continue with installation.\par
